{"version":1,"content":"<p>舞台王者郭富城（城城）將於12月31日及明年1月1日首踏啟德主場館舉行《郭富城ICONIC MOMENT啟德跨年演唱會26/27》，其經理人小美近日在社交網分享個唱進程，公開啟動舞台機關的短片，預先帶粉絲進入城城的全新國度。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.192741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.288513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.288513+00:00","content_hash":"e3ed32ac1daca0dc88eea370e7f8ca5bef205ce784cd06e02e796befa9ae483e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}